<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Dashboard – ArgenGaming Admin</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; background: #131315; color: #fff; margin: 0; }
    header { background: #1e1e20; padding: 1rem 2rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a2c; }
    header h1 { color: #00dbe9; margin: 0; font-size: 1.3rem; }
    header a { color: #aaa; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    header a:hover { color: #fff; }
    main { padding: 2rem; }
    h2 { color: #00dbe9; }
    .cards { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .card { background: #1e1e20; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem 2rem; flex: 1; border: 1px solid #2a2a2c; }
    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; color: #aaa; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .card a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; color: #00dbe9; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>ArgenGaming — Panel Admin</h1>
    <span>Hola, <strong><%= email %></strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="/admin/logout">Cerrar sesión</a></span>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>Dashboard</h2>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Productos</h3>
        <p>Ver, agregar y editar productos del catálogo.</p>
        <a href="/admin/productos">Ir a productos</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Ventas</h3>
        <p>Ver el historial de compras realizadas.</p>
        <a href="/admin/ventas">Ir a ventas</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
